WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.890
Availability and acceptance are different facts Use the handover

00:00:04.916 --> 00:00:07.942
method to check whether a specific cover arrangement is

00:00:07.982 --> 00:00:12.126
actually accepted A colleague may be listed as deputy

00:00:12.192 --> 00:00:15.679
and be available today yet have accepted no particular

00:00:15.719 --> 00:00:19.797
assignment We will test that distinction before seeing how

00:00:19.837 --> 00:00:21.495
the fictional case develops
